Z||000007||RossT||08-12-99||10:59 PM||||ezsurf, when I bought my fiero about 4<br>months ago, I too wanted to decode<br>all the RPO codes. I found a gentleman<br>who had a t-top registry, and also who<br>was just starting a non t-top registry. He was very kind to send me a two page print<br>out with all the codes decoded. It looks very much like the original window sticker<br>but with much more information on it. It is a nice piece to have.<p>He does not charge for his service, but a dollar or two to offset printing and postage<br>would not be declined.<p>e-mail him all of the following:<p>  raypaulk@fierottopp.com<p>1. car's VIN<br>2. a list of the RPO codes<br>3. mileage<br>4. owner info-  name,address,tel etc.<p>Make sure all the info above is included.<br>He is very busy, so be patient.<p>this is for both  non t-tops and t-tops cars .<p>Ross<p>
